# ============================================================================
# MONTE CARLO SIMULATION: HRF ETIOLOGY AS COMPETITIVE PROCESS
# ============================================================================
# Model:
#   - MP burden per retina -> Poisson particle count (truncated lognormal
#     diameter, Dirichlet-sampled polymer composition density)
#   - Spatial congruence and optical match (possibly correlated)
#   - Hierarchical patient -> eyes -> HRF structure with optional
#     overdispersion on HRF count
#   - Per-HRF probability of MP association via saturating binomial
#     competition:
#         p = (1 - f) * (1 - exp(-potential / hrf_count))
#     capped at the biological ceiling (1 - f)
# ============================================================================

